{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は東北楽天イーグルスvs北海道日本ハムファイターズの試合の始球式を乃木坂46がやらせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投げたのはまいやん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで試合の前にガールズルールを披露させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場のファンのみなさん暖かく迎えてくださってありがとうございますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ドームはやっぱり広い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"試合も観戦しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロ野球を見るのは初めてなので終始興奮していました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に貴重な体験をさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"田中選手、12連勝おめでとうございます！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂もパワーを頂いてのびていかねばっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/10/8750980/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/10/8750980/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/10/8750980/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}